288 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 251 0 R
/E (Walmart, as one of the largest global retail networks, generates massive and diverse weekly sales data. Accurate forecasting is vital to keep shelves stocked, manage inventory, and satisfy customers, with studies confirming its importance for supply chain decisions like promotions and distribution \(Salamena, Fataruba, & Tappa, 2025\). However, Walmart struggles to predict demand: overstock wastes resources, while stockouts frustrate customers. Research shows poor forecasting leads to financial losses, highlighting the need for smarter, data-driven approaches \(Said et al., 2026; Kabir et al., 2026\).)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
